model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8, finding 4 (P24): two places of unit any alive before S, each with a PLN leg on 2026-03-01. broker has an opening in EUR only: PLN, which it has no opening of, is the hole before S (\"has no balance before 2026-01-01\") before and after the leg, and EUR is its opening. broker2 has no opening at all: every read of it is \"no opening or stated reading\". Both engines print these (R14, read unit by unit)."

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..
place broker2: wallets lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input day: date

move buy: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to broker amount amt

move buy2: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to broker2 amount amt

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 7.00 PLN "s"
  day = 2026-03-01 "s"
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask p: bal(broker, PLN, 2026-02-15), bal(broker, PLN, 2026-03-05), bal(broker, EUR, 2026-03-05)

ask p2: bal(broker2, PLN, 2026-02-15), bal(broker2, PLN, 2026-03-05), bal(broker2, EUR, 2026-03-05)
